# GHSA-6v7p-g79w-8964 (msgpack < 1.2.1, DoS via Unpacker reuse)
# This CVE is triggered by pip's internally vendored msgpack copy (pip/_vendor/msgpack),
# not by any package installed directly by this project. No released pip version
# (checked up to pip 26.2) vendors a fixed msgpack (>=1.2.1). Cannot be remediated
# from this repository until pip upstream updates its vendored dependency.
# Re-evaluate when upgrading pip in deployment/docker/Dockerfile.
GHSA-6v7p-g79w-8964
